{"2945240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ker-Chunk!", "steam_appid": 2945240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<i>HIIIII im kalva. I love stikrs and nip. my favorate foob is cearbord. can you help me find my nip?</i><br><br>Ker-Chunk! is a small game I made as my senior thesis. You follow Kalva, a Co-Alo, and his journey to find treasure as well as his missing catnip. The game is a 3D sidescroller with some hand-drawn elements. The entire game is voice-acted, subtitled, and easy to play. Ker-Chunk is also very PG and safe for all audiences. I spent many months creating this small slice of planet Bethal, so enjoy! <br><br>-Mint", "about_the_game": "<i>HIIIII im kalva. I love stikrs and nip. my favorate foob is cearbord. can you help me find my nip?</i><br><br>Ker-Chunk! is a small game I made as my senior thesis. You follow Kalva, a Co-Alo, and his journey to find treasure as well as his missing catnip. The game is a 3D sidescroller with some hand-drawn elements. The entire game is voice-acted, subtitled, and easy to play. Ker-Chunk is also very PG and safe for all audiences. I spent many months creating this small slice of planet Bethal, so enjoy! <br><br>-Mint", "short_description": "Kalva is a bit clumsy, losing all his catnip, but maybe, just maybe, this weird catnip-eating cave has some treasure in it.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945240/header.jpg?t=1722444101", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945240/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1722444101", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945240/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1722444101", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 1